{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10642030","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10642030","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1064203001:0":{"text":"지금까지 마물을 만나지 않았다니, 운이 참 좋네. 하지만 방심하면 안 돼. 이 근처 마물은 청각보다 후각이 더 예민하니까 서쪽 가시나무 덤불은 피해서 돌아가자.","source_cn":"算我们运气好，到现在都没撞见魔物。但不能大意，这里的魔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBEE7FA4DA9EFD17C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1064203002:0":{"text":"오빠는 여기 지리에 익숙한 것 같네요.","source_cn":"埃因哥哥，你对这里好像很了解。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5FE38B450ADE169","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1064203003:1":{"text":"아니, 그냥 마물에 대해 잘 아는 것뿐이야.","source_cn":"不，我只是比较了解魔物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFFD5B127F2775DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1064203004:0":{"text":"...아인 오빠, 들려요? 풀숲에서 이상한 소리가 나요.","source_cn":"……埃因哥哥，你听到了吗？草丛里有奇怪的声音……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31FC6A6205AB7E67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1064203005:1":{"text":"내가 가서 볼 테니까 걱정하지 마. 녀석이 놀라지 않도록 너는 내 뒤를 잘 따라오고.","source_cn":"别害怕，我去看看。你跟在我身后，不要惊扰它。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x085D6AFE1E716F89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:9:1064203006:0":{"text":"아인은 손에 쥔 검을 꽉 잡고, 자세를 낮춘 채 풀숲 쪽으로 다가갔다","source_cn":"埃因握紧手中的剑，压低重心向发出声音的草丛走去","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3FCEF0FEB991E00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:10:1064203007:0":{"text":"하지만 풀숲 너머의 광경을 확인한 아인은 그 자리에 얼어붙고 말았다","source_cn":"当他拨开野草，出现在眼前的景象却令他震惊不已","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41C7F914156A49E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1064203008:0":{"text":"...윽...","source_cn":"……呃……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x577A255C87A2ED28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1064203009:0":{"text":"마이카... 마이카?! 정말 너야?!","source_cn":"迈克尔……迈克尔？！真的是你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FE2BFE957914D15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1064203010:1":{"text":"정신 차려! 나야, 아인이라고!","source_cn":"振作一点！是我啊，埃因！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51CB46C814E862ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1064203011:1":{"text":"윽... 아파...","source_cn":"呃……疼……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE92C5FD5056BBF7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1064203012:1":{"text":"아인 오빠. 이 사람 많이 다쳤어요... 치료가 필요할 거 같아요.","source_cn":"埃因哥哥，他受了很重的伤……需要治疗。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C40F87B9271B1B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1064203013:1":{"text":"어른들이 전쟁터의 후방에는 의사가 있고, 성당의 마법사도 있다고 그랬어요. 그 사람들이라면 상처를 치료해 줄 수 있을 거예요.","source_cn":"大人们说，战场的后方有医生，有圣堂的魔法师，他们可以治...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6384343E9ED6A433","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1064203014:1":{"text":"이 사람도 데리고 같이 도망쳐요.","source_cn":"我们，带他一起逃生吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A90D7E477F91775","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1064203015:1":{"text":"같이 도망쳐...?","source_cn":"逃生……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE70680E92612023","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1064203016:1":{"text":"아니... 마이카는 데려갈 수 없어...","source_cn":"不……不能带上他……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01B16C990DCCF2B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1064203017:1":{"text":"왜요? 아직 살아 있잖아요.","source_cn":"为什么？他还活着。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x049C36FAFB672B14","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1064203018:1":{"text":"나도 모르겠어... 하지만 데려갈 수 없어... 마이카를 데려간다면 아무도 살아남을 수 없을 거야!","source_cn":"我不知道……总之我们不能带他走……如果带着他，谁都活不了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7CA733EC80C432A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1064203019:1":{"text":"하지만 오빠가 아는 사람이잖아요... 전우 아니에요?","source_cn":"可是你认识他……他是你的战友，对不对？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D7106A432F6FB71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1064203020:1":{"text":"마이카를 구하고 나면, 그 뒤는? 지난 번처럼 마물에게 쫓기고 우리 셋 다 사이 좋게 죽으라는 거야?!","source_cn":"救了他，然后呢？像上次一样，被魔物追上？三个人一起死在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC3979AD0DE804AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1064203021:1":{"text":"잠깐... 저번에 마이카는 분명...","source_cn":"上次……对啊，还有上次。迈克尔他明明——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC0445D0817567D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1064203022:1":{"text":"아... 아인... 제, 제발...","source_cn":"埃……埃因……我的，朋友……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4FF62F572D2C0FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1064203023:1":{"text":"...도와달라고 하고 있잖아요. 저 사람을 구할 수 있는 건 오빠뿐이에요.","source_cn":"……他在向你求救。只有你能救他。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x544453CBD4D55FE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1064203024:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"………………","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x197F0BE8A09E0D34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1064203025:1":{"text":"아아아... 아니, 아니야... 아니야!\n난 마이카를 구할 수 없어... 구하고 싶지 않아!","source_cn":"啊啊啊……不……不、不、不!\\n我不能救他……我不想救他！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4EABC77CE5972007","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1064203026:1":{"text":"오, 이런... 한심한 겁쟁이 녀석. 꼴이 아주 볼만하네!","source_cn":"噢，天哪……真是一只软脚虾，一个彻头彻尾的懦夫！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6360487EE83C83B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1064203027:1":{"text":"...?!","source_cn":"……？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CC9DC7FC7DBD913","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1064203028:1":{"text":"징병관 꽁무니를 쫓아다니며, 평생 물러서지 않는 전사가 되겠다고 맹세했던 건 넌데. 그 맹세도 낡아빠진 군화처럼 쓰레기통에 처박은 모양이지?","source_cn":"当年你追在征兵官屁股后面，保证成为永不退缩的战士的誓言...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1AD9FDE6B1C603F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1064203029:1":{"text":"아니, 방금 그건 군화에 대한 모욕이군. 낡아빠진 군화짝은 전장에 나가는 놈들에게 억지로 신길 수라도 있지. 하지만 넌? 넌 그 어떤 가치도 없어. 넌 그저 구제 불능의...","source_cn":"哦不不，磨破的靴子在战场上还有回收利用价值。你呢？你可...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96836820B83A1127","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1064203030:1":{"text":"...!","source_cn":"……！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA011D3AC55021EC4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1064203031:1":{"text":"또 그 목소리야... 대체 누구냐고! 나와!","source_cn":"又是那个声音……到底是谁在说话！谁？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D59A1D24BDBF5E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1064203032:1":{"text":"무... 무슨 소리요? 전 아무것도 못 들었는데...","source_cn":"什……什么声音？我没有听到啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9022EDE60CEF00EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1064203033:1":{"text":"아인 오빠, 너무 긴장한 거 아니에요? 아마... 신경이 날카로워져서 헛것을 들은 걸 거예요.","source_cn":"埃因哥哥，是不是你太紧张了？嗯……一定是这样的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2BB5480B9AD24A75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1064203034:1":{"text":"긴장 풀어요... 긴장하지 않아도 돼요. 오빠는 그냥, 음... 마음이 흔들리는 것뿐이니까요.","source_cn":"放轻松……不用紧张。你只是，唔……只是心里有些动摇……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x348DA4CA2E78DC66","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1064203035:1":{"text":"마음이 흔들린다...","source_cn":"我的心里……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E2008E1B18AE3CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1064203036:1":{"text":"...그래, 맞아.\n군대에 들어온 이유도, 예전에 했던 맹세도 나만 알고 있는 거니까...","source_cn":"……对，你说得对。\\n加入军队的原因，曾经许下的誓言，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA78B34191319E98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1064203037:0":{"text":"근데 군대에는... 왜 들어간 거예요?","source_cn":"你加入军队的原因……是什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A73F53CCD3832FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1064203038:1":{"text":"...마물을 처치하고 사람들을 구하려고.\n...절대 물러서지 않으려고.","source_cn":"……击溃魔物，保护他人……\\n……永不退缩。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x129F4DE1CDE16F7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1064203039:0":{"text":"다행이네요... 또렷하게 기억하고 있네요.","source_cn":"太好了……你记得很清楚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x705ACEEB57427AE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1064203040:0":{"text":"그럼 마이카를 구해줘요... 오빠가 저에게 손을 내밀어 준 것처럼요.","source_cn":"那么，请救救迈克尔吧……就像，你愿意对我伸出援手那样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAEDC50736D95ADB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1064203041:0":{"text":"...","source_cn":"………………","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x197F0BE8A09E0D34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1064203042:0":{"text":"...알겠어.","source_cn":"——好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB37F7A27FF2EE743","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:55:1064203043:0":{"text":"마이카, 조금만 더 버텨! 내가 반드시 이 지옥에서 널 데리고 나갈 테니까!","source_cn":"迈克尔，再坚持一下……我一定会带你离开这个破地方！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD435C33F3EF23E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:56:1064203044:0":{"text":"아... 인...","source_cn":"……埃、因……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CD4A95ED66489E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:57:1064203045:0":{"text":"고... 고마워...","source_cn":"谢……谢谢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x332D69223ABFF5F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:58:1064203046:1":{"text":"그런 말 하지 마. 우린 전우잖아!","source_cn":"别说这些。你可是我的战友！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4141B7B61E4802B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:59:1064203047:1":{"text":"먼저 앞에 있는 숲을 빠져나가자!","source_cn":"走！先穿过前面那片树林！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA3FE11214D5053D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:61:1064203048:0":{"text":"밤의 장막 아래, 세 사람은 서로를 부축한 채 전장을 뒤로하고 무거운 발걸음을 옮겼